## Test Scenarios

### Scenario 1: Layout Verification ([all pages])
```
For each viewport size:
- Render page
- Take screenshot
- Verify no horizontal scroll
- Verify all critical elements visible
- Verify grid columns match expected breakpoints
```

### Scenario 2: Navigation Testing ([core + admin pages])
```
Mobile (<768px):
- Hamburger menu visible
- Desktop nav hidden
- Click hamburger → drawer open
- Verify all nav links present
- Close drawer → click outside or X button

Desktop (≥768px):
- Desktop nav visible
- Hamburger menu hidden
- All nav links clickable
```

### Scenario 3: Touch Interaction Testing ([performer, tournament pages])
```
For mobile viewports:
- Tap performer card → profile page
- Tap tournament → details/entry flow
- Tap buttons → 44x44px minimum size
- Verify no accidental taps
- Test swipe gestures if applicable
```

### Scenario 4: Form Testing ([signup, admin pages])
```
- Input fields full-width on mobile
- Font-size ≥16px (no iOS zoom)
- Submit buttons full-width on mobile
- Form validation displays inline
```

### Scenario 5: Image & Media Testing ([performer, marketplace pages])
```
- Images scale correctly
- No overflow
- Lazy loading (if implemented) works
- Touch to zoom (if applicable)
```

